# --- EvoPro host state -------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is governed as an Evolution Protocol host, so the durable part
# of .evolution/ is versioned on purpose: the goal, the sprints, the accumulated
# knowledge and CONTINUITY.md are what let a fresh agent in a fresh clone
# reconstruct context. That is the whole point of "repository-native".
#
# What is excluded below is measured, not decided: snapshots, baselines,
# command output and the active task are re-derived from the working tree on the
# next run, and versioning them would produce a merge conflict per cycle.
.evolution/runtime/
.evolution/logs/
